  dialogueLines:
  - '"YOU!!!!!"'
  - '"I knew something was wrong."'
  - '"Did you think I woudn''t find out?!"'
  - '"A mother always knows when her baby isn''t well."'
  - '"I can''t get over this mistake of yours. It''s OVER!!!"'
  - '"I''m taking my daughter back home. I don''t trust an idiot like you to turn her back."'
